This license allows you to use the software for any noncommercial purpose.

## Agreement

In order to receive this license, you have to agree to its terms. If you don't agree, you can't use the software.

## Noncommercial Purpose

Noncommercial purposes include:
- using the software for your own personal use
- using the software for research
- using the software for educational purposes
- using the software for any other purpose that does not have as its primary goal or result commercial advantage or monetary compensation

Commercial purposes include:
- selling the software or copies of the software
- selling services that use the software
- using the software to provide a commercial service
- using the software for internal business operations of a commercial entity

